1078   2        }
1079   1      
1080   1        /* Low-battery LED_G: 0.2 s period (0.1 s on / 0.1 s off), same scheme as the
1081   1         * fire LED_R above - toggle on each 0.1 s Timer2 tick. Keeps blinking while a
1082   1         * blocking Play_Clip(AUDIO_CLIP_LOWBAT) runs (audio on Timer1 ISR keeps global
1083   1         * interrupts enabled, so Timer2 still fires). */
